[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9600.23, "timestamp": "02:40:00", "text": "等等，我应该在这里吗？不，不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9603.349, "timestamp": "02:40:03", "text": "这里。我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9606.469, "timestamp": "02:40:06", "text": "还有，你们一般玩多久？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9609.429, "timestamp": "02:40:09", "text": "呃，再等个10分钟、15分钟吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9617.349, "timestamp": "02:40:17", "text": "好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9619.11, "timestamp": "02:40:19", "text": "呃，据说还有另一笔交易。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9621.99, "timestamp": "02:40:21", "text": "这里。具体时间是什么时候呢？那是一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9623.99, "timestamp": "02:40:23", "text": "下午。哦，那是下午的事了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9625.91, "timestamp": "02:40:25", "text": "好了，我想我们已经全部完成了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9628.23, "timestamp": "02:40:28", "text": "午夜特惠。是的，有三个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9630.87, "timestamp": "02:40:30", "text": "消息。 11小时内完成貂皮交易。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9633.429, "timestamp": "02:40:33", "text": "向上移动。和先生谈谈。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9637.59, "timestamp": "02:40:37", "text": "我们走吧，伙计们。快点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9639.91, "timestamp": "02:40:39", "text": "你好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9643.27, "timestamp": "02:40:43", "text": "或者我们就住酒店，穿貂皮大衣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9645.83, "timestamp": "02:40:45", "text": "然后我们就结束直播。全部"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9650.13, "timestamp": "02:40:50", "text": "正确的。是的。 EP时间。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9652.07, "timestamp": "02:40:52", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9658.63, "timestamp": "02:40:58", "text": "奖金。我现在是五号街头混混了。"}]